  "hansa.pell": {
   "kind": "event",
   "arc": "hansa",
   "act": 1,
   "title": "{young_hauler.short} at fifty-nine",
   "requires": {
    "at_type": "Planet",
    "turn_min": 8,
    "done": "hansa.first_mark"
   },
   "text": [
    "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. In the back room of the needle office he teaches new haulers how to book, where to sit, and what the Cargolytes take from the tail."
   ],
   "chance": 0.3,
   "who": [
    "young_hauler"
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "requires": {
      "player_origin": {
       "flag": "pell_friend"
      }
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa, with a seat on the needle council and the same grin as at nineteen.",
      "'You flew with me when I had nothing,' he says. 'Book us into the same needle and I'll take the place behind you.'"
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "player_origin": {
         "flag": "pell_lent"
        }
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. He pays back the ten thousand you lent him at nineteen, with forty years of interest at the Hansa's rate, worked out to the credit."
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "player_origin": {
         "flag": "pell_redeemed"
        }
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_lent"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. 'You took me back from the raiders,' he tells the young haulers around him. 'Nobody else would have. Remember that when somebody asks you.'"
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "player_origin": {
         "flag": "pell_turned_away"
        }
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_lent"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_redeemed"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. He remembers the captain who turned a nineteen-year-old away from the dock, and he is polite about it, which is worse."
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "player_origin": {
         "flag": "fought_pell"
        }
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_lent"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_redeemed"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_turned_away"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa, with a scar along his jaw from a fight on a lane forty years ago.",
      "'I was on the wrong side of it,' he says. 'So were you.' Then he buys you a drink."
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "player_origin": {
         "flag": "paid_pell"
        }
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_lent"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_redeemed"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_turned_away"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "fought_pell"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. 'You paid me to go away,' he says. 'I went. Then I came back with a ship.'"
     ]
    },
    {
     "requires": {
      "all": [
       {
        "any": [
         {
          "player_origin": {
           "flag": "pell_taught"
          }
         },
         {
          "player_origin": {
           "flag": "pell_advised"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "any": [
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_friend"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_lent"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_redeemed"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "pell_turned_away"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "fought_pell"
           }
          },
          {
           "player_origin": {
            "flag": "paid_pell"
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     "text": [
      "{young_hauler} is fifty-nine and a senior of the Hansa. 'You told me to keep my receipts and stay out of the tail,' he says. 'I still do. Mostly.'"
     ]
    }
   ],
